+++ b/features/routing.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@
+Feature: URL routing and filtering
+  As a user
+  I want to filter todos by URL hash
+  So that I can view all, active, or completed todos
+
+  Background:
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And "Walk dog" is marked completed
+
+  Rule: Default route shows all todos
+
+  Scenario: All route shows every todo
+    Given I navigate to "#/"
+    Then I see 2 todos in the list
+    And the "All" filter link has class "selected"
+
+  Rule: Active route
+
+  Scenario: Active route shows only incomplete todos
+    Given I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+    And I see a todo with title "Buy milk"
+    And I do not see a todo with title "Walk dog"
+    And the "Active" filter link has class "selected"
+
+  Rule: Completed route
+
+  Scenario: Completed route shows only done todos
+    Given I navigate to "#/completed"
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+    And I see a todo with title "Walk dog"
+    And I do not see a todo with title "Buy milk"
+    And the "Completed" filter link has class "selected"
+
+  Rule: Filtered updates on todo state change
+
+  Scenario: Completing a todo while on active filter hides it
+    Given I navigate to "#/active"
+    When I mark "Buy milk" as completed
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Scenario: Un-completing a todo while on completed filter hides it
+    Given I navigate to "#/completed"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for "Walk dog"
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Rule: Filter persistence on reload
+
+  Scenario: Active filter persists on page reload
+    Given I navigate to "#/active"
+    When I reload the page
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+    And the "Active" filter link has class "selected"
+
+  Rule: Clear completed from filtered view
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes done todos from completed view
+    Given I navigate to "#/completed"
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+    And the clear-completed button is hidden
\ No newline at end of file
