@@ -0,0 +1,160 @@
+Feature: Todo CRUD and display
+  As a user
+  I want to manage todo items
+  So that I can track what needs to be done
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: New todo creation
+
+  Scenario: Create a todo
+    Given no todos exist
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list with title "Buy milk"
+    And the new-todo input is cleared
+    And #main and #footer are visible
+
+  Scenario: Trim whitespace from new todo
+    Given no todos exist
+    When I type "   Walk dog   " into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list with title "Walk dog"
+
+  Scenario: Ignore empty todo
+    Given no todos exist
+    When I type "" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Scenario: Ignore whitespace-only todo
+    Given no todos exist
+    When I type "   " into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Rule: No-todos initial state
+
+  Scenario: Hide main and footer when no todos
+    Given no todos exist
+    Then #main is hidden
+    And #footer is hidden
+
+  Rule: Mark todos as complete
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a single todo
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "completed"
+    And its toggle checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as complete
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos have class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all reflects individual state
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I mark "Walk dog" as completed
+    When I inspect the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checks when all are complete
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I mark "Buy milk" as completed
+    And I mark "Walk dog" as completed
+    When I inspect the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Rule: Delete todo
+
+  Scenario: Delete a todo via destroy button
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the destroy button for "Buy milk"
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+    And #main and #footer are hidden
+
+  Rule: Todo counter
+
+  Scenario: Display active count with singular
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo-count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Display active count with plural
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I mark "Walk dog" as completed
+    Then the todo-count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Display zero active count
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I mark "Buy milk" as completed
+    Then the todo-count shows "0 items left"
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes done todos
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I mark "Buy milk" as completed
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+    And the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Hide clear-completed when none completed
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed toggles toggle-all unchecked
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I mark "Buy milk" as completed
+    And I mark "Walk dog" as completed
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked
+
+  Rule: Editing
+
+  Scenario: Double-click activates editing mode
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "editing"
+    And the edit input for "Buy milk" contains "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Save edit on Enter
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing "Buy milk"
+    When I type "Buy organic milk" into the edit input and press Enter
+    Then I see a todo with title "Buy organic milk"
+    And the todo "Buy organic milk" does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: Save edit on blur
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing "Buy milk"
+    When I type "Buy oat milk" into the edit input and blur
+    Then I see a todo with title "Buy oat milk"
+    And the todo "Buy oat milk" does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: Trim edit input
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing "Buy milk"
+    When I type "   Buy oat milk   " into the edit input and press Enter
+    Then I see a todo with title "Buy oat milk"
+
+  Scenario: Destroy todo when edit is empty
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing "Buy milk"
+    When I type "" into the edit input and press Enter
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Scenario: Destroy todo when edit is whitespace
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing "Buy milk"
+    When I type "   " into the edit input and press Enter
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Scenario: Cancel edit with Escape
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing "Buy milk"
+    When I press Escape while editing
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" does not have class "editing"
+    And I see a todo with title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: new-todo input is autofocused on load
+    Given the page is loaded
+    Then the new-todo input has focus
\ No newline at end of file
